released under CC BY 4.0 to the extent the author holds rights in them. They
remain subject to the licences of the models that produced them:
- Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct and kev-8b: Apache License 2.0;
- auto-j-13b: built on Llama 2 and released by its authors under the Llama 2
